WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:07,010
Why did the boss suddenly speak in the group?

2
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:09,260
Could it be that Chi Kuang and the others sent people to sneak attack on the poisonous Gu boss?

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,260
Was killed

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,260
Damn it, Damn it

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,260
The boss is so handsome

6
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,260
I just like this kind of domineering attitude.

7
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,260
Hu Xielianguo’s head was black after being fucked hard

8
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:17,260
It means they can't make a sneak attack

9
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,260
Was killed

10
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:21,260
But it’s not necessarily the result of the Chi Kuang trio’s instigation, right?

11
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,260
I just figured out what's going on, boss

12
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,260
We're freezing to death

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,260
Do you want to sell your immunity to us?

14
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:30,260
We won’t sell green fur suits either.

15
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,260
It will be difficult for us to survive now

16
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,260
How dare I go to find out about you?

17
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,260
If we three brothers got it before

18
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,260
None of this is possible

19
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,260
This is not your business

20
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,260
If our three brothers had offended you before

21
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,260
Can I kneel down and apologize to you?

22
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,420
Give ordinary people a way to survive

23
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,030
This is not accepted

24
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:50,600
Then I'll change my approach

25
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,890
Draw three positioning cards at a high price

26
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:55,240
Can be exchanged for anything without funds

27
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,240
The boss wants a location card

28
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,240
Who wants a location card?

29
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,240
Move directly to heaven

30
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,240
Oh my god

31
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,240
I have a card

32
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:02,240
Just opened it from the silver box yesterday

33
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,240
I, Xu Sizhi, haven’t finished it yet

34
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,240
who would want

35
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,240
I was so angry that I couldn't sleep all night

36
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:06,240
Didn't expect that

37
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,240
The wind has turned

38
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,240
I'll send it to you now
